---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
    <main>
      <section>
        <h1>Ren Blanding</h1>
        <h2>Product-Focused UI/UX Designer</h2>
        <h2>@ Keurig Dr Pepper</h2>
        <h2>Based in Chicago, IL</h2>
        <button>View my projects</button>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div><h3>About Me</h3></div>
        <p>Currently designing user interfaces and creating user flows for Keurig's lineup of commercial and consumer smart coffee brewers. Formerly worked on creating Keurig's Design System, as well as creating components and maintaining existing design systems for the American Academy of Pediatrics and National Association of Corporate Directors.</p>
        <p>When I’m not at work I volunteer, climb, and work on my homelab. (welcome to my IDE theme!)</p>
      </section>      
      
      <section>
        <div><h3>Previous Clients</h3></div>      
        <ul>
          <li>Keurig Dr Pepper</li>
          <li>American Academy of Pediatrics</li>
          <li>National Association of Corporate Directors</li>
          <li>Spartan Chemical</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      

      <section>
        <div><h3>Let's Talk</h3></div>
        <p>You can reach me anytime between normal business hours in the Central Time Zone. I am available through the following: </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email - <a href="#">hello@blandingdesign.com</a></li>
          <li>LinkedIn - <a href="#">blandingr</a></li>
          <li>GitHub - <a href="#">hakata-jpn</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section> 

        <!-- TODO: Add time zone PLEASE, using MDN's Temporal 
      <p>
        It is currently () in Chicago right now. 
      </p>  -->
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
